  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RAISE PUBLIC AWARENESS OF ISSUES AROUND THE RECRUITMENT OF CHILDREN BY FARC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A Comprehensive Communication strategy project will design and promote the research report on illegal recruitment and use of children and adolescent by the FARC in the Colombian armed conflict. This research report is being developed by the Colombian think tank Instituto de Ciencia Pol&#xED;tica Hern&#xE1;n Echavarr&#xED;a Ol&#xF3;zaga (ICP) in coordination with the Truth, Coexistence and Non-Repetition Commission (Truth Commission) and the Special Jurisdiction for Peace (JEP by its Spanish acronym), both being part of the Comprehensive System of Truth Justice Reparation and Non-Repetition in the framework of the Agreement for the Termination of the Conflict and the Construction of a Stable and Lasting Peace between the National Government of Colombia and the FARC in 2016.</narrative>
  </description>
